Assuming it's the same as in standard Nethack, it doesn't matter if it's 
ID'd and there is a 1/(13+X*2) chance of getting a djinni per potion, 
which X is the number of djinni you've found in potions so far. In other 
words, 1/13 for the first one, 1/15 for the second, etc. If you do get a 
djinni, the chance that it gives you a wish is 80% for blessed potions, 
20% for uncursed and 5% for cursed.

